{
    "_comment": [
        "============================================================================",
        " FAUCETFLOW FAUCET DEFINITIONS",
        "============================================================================",
        " WARNING: Faucet websites change their HTML frequently. All selectors",
        " below are best-effort and WILL need adjustment over time. If a faucet",
        " stops working, inspect the page live and update the selectors here.",
        "",
        " SELECTOR FORMAT:",
        "   Plain string  — CSS selector (e.g. \"#id\", \".class\", \"input[name=foo]\")",
        "   xpath: prefix — XPath expression (e.g. \"xpath://input[@placeholder='Address']\")",
        "",
        " MUTUAL EXCLUSIVITY:",
        "   wallet_address_field and connect_wallet_button cannot both be non-null",
        "   in the same faucet entry. Exactly one must be present.",
        "",
        " OPTIONAL FIELDS:",
        "   checkbox           — Single checkbox selector to tick before submitting",
        "   close_ad_button    — Selector for popup/ad close button",
        "   wallet_indexes     — Array of 0-based wallet indices to use for this",
        "                        faucet. Omit to use all configured wallets.",
        "============================================================================"
    ],

